= Internal Factions of the SPD

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The NDP's free-market modernizers, who believe the party's future lies in open markets, fiscal discipline, and socially liberal politics. They are the faction most comfortable with a deal with F&J or a Social Front that stays economically moderate.">Liberal</span>!} strength: [+ liberal_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ liberal_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The party's managerial core, pragmatists who believe the NDP's strength is its ability to govern competently and hold the center together, and who now find themselves blamed by everyone for the party's decline. They are not ideologically committed to anything except the party's survival and their own institutional position, which makes them flexible in negotiations but incapable of offering voters a story.">Center</span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The NDP's law-and-order, defense-hawk, culturally traditional faction. They are the faction most tempted by a deal with TPK.">Conservative</span>!} strength: [+ conservative_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ conservative_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="A rump of liberal-social members: more redistributionist than the liberals, more culturally progressive than the centrists, but not left enough to be comfortable with even the mildest members from PSE. Progressives have spent years being tolerated rather than heard, and year after year kept bleeding their members to Unity! or running as Independents.">Progressive</span>!} strength: [+ progressive_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ progressive_dissent : dissent +]


@paramilitaries
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.rb_strength) {
    Q.rb_strength_2 = Q.rb_strength.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.rfb_strength) {
    Q.rfb_strength_2 = Q.rfb_strength.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.sh_strength) {
    Q.sh_strength_2 = Q.sh_strength.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.sa_strength) {
    Q.sa_strength_2 = Q.sa_strength.toFixed(1);
}
!}

